 sp {apply*opticflow-mid-check
    (state <s> ^operator.name opticflow-mid-check
            ^check opticflow-mid
               ^io.output-link <out>)
    (<out> ^cybersickness-level <cl>)

-->
    (<s> ^check <c> - latency +)
    (write (crlf) |Affected...|)
    (<out> ^cybersickness-level <cl> - affected +)
}